@startuml
title Scenario E2E Phase 1 - Gateway CanTelcoX

autonumber
actor "Abonne\nparticulier / PME" as User
participant "API Gateway\nNGINX" as Gateway
participant "svc-clients-identite" as Identity
database "DB clients_identite\ncustomers, mfa_challenges" as IdentityDb
participant "svc-catalogue-offres" as Catalog
database "DB catalogue_offres\noffers" as CatalogDb
participant "svc-commandes-activations" as Orders
database "DB commandes_activations\norders, activations" as OrdersDb
participant "svc-lignes-services" as Lines
database "DB lignes_services\nservice_lines" as LinesDb
participant "HLR/free5GC adapter\nou mock" as Hlr
participant "svc-usage-facturation" as Billing
database "DB usage_facturation\ninvoices, payments" as BillingDb
participant "Passerelle de paiement\nsimulee" as Payment
participant "svc-conformite-audit" as Audit
database "DB conformite_audit\naudit_events append-only" as AuditDb

== UC-01 - Inscription et verification d'identite simulee ==

User -> Gateway : POST /v1/customers/register\nTraceId + payload inscription
Gateway -> Identity : forward
Identity -> Identity : valider donnees,\nhasher mot de passe et document
Identity -> IdentityDb : INSERT customer\nstatus=ACTIVE,\nidentityStatus=VERIFIED,\nriskLevel=LOW
Identity -> Audit : POST /v1/audit-events\nCUSTOMER_REGISTERED
Audit -> AuditDb : INSERT audit_events
Audit --> Identity : 201
Identity --> Gateway : 201 customer
Gateway --> User : 201 Created\ncustomerId

note over Identity
Phase 1: KYC/risk est simule dans le service.
OTP/MFA n'est pas dans UC-01; il est traite par UC-02.
end note

== UC-02 - Login et MFA ==

User -> Gateway : POST /v1/auth/login\nemail + password
Gateway -> Identity : forward
Identity -> IdentityDb : SELECT customer,\nUPDATE login risk
Identity -> IdentityDb : INSERT MfaChallenge\nOTP demo 123456
Identity -> Audit : POST /v1/audit-events\nLOGIN_MFA_REQUIRED
Audit -> AuditDb : INSERT audit_events
Identity --> Gateway : 202 challengeId,\ndevOtp, mfaRequired
Gateway --> User : 202 MFA required

User -> Gateway : POST /v1/auth/mfa/verify\nchallengeId + otp
Gateway -> Identity : forward
Identity -> IdentityDb : SELECT challenge,\nUPDATE status=VERIFIED
Identity -> Audit : POST /v1/audit-events\nMFA_VERIFIED
Audit -> AuditDb : INSERT audit_events
Identity --> Gateway : 200 sessionToken
Gateway --> User : 200 authenticated

== UC-05 - Consultation offres et commande idempotente ==

User -> Gateway : GET /v1/offers\nAuthorization Bearer sessionToken
Gateway -> Identity : /v1/auth/introspect
Identity --> Gateway : token valide
Gateway -> Catalog : GET /v1/offers
Catalog -> CatalogDb : SELECT active offers
Catalog --> Gateway : 200 offers
Gateway --> User : 200 liste offres

User -> Gateway : POST /v1/orders\nIdempotency-Key + customerId,\nofferId, orderType=NEW_PLAN
Gateway -> Identity : /v1/auth/introspect
Identity --> Gateway : token valide
Gateway -> Orders : forward
Orders -> OrdersDb : find_order_by_idempotency_key(key)
Orders -> Identity : GET /v1/customers/{customerId}
Identity --> Orders : ACTIVE, VERIFIED, riskLevel
Orders -> Catalog : GET /v1/offers/{offerId}
Catalog --> Orders : offre ACTIVE, prix
Orders -> OrdersDb : INSERT order\nstatus=ACCEPTED,\nrequest_hash
Orders -> Audit : POST /v1/audit-events\nORDER_ACCEPTED
Audit -> AuditDb : INSERT audit_events
Orders --> Gateway : 201 order ACCEPTED
Gateway --> User : 201 commande acceptee

opt Rejeu idempotent meme payload
  User -> Gateway : POST /v1/orders\nmeme Idempotency-Key + meme payload
  Gateway -> Orders : forward
  Orders -> OrdersDb : find_order_by_idempotency_key(key)
  OrdersDb --> Orders : stored response
  Orders --> Gateway : 201 stored response\nIdempotency-Replayed=true
  Gateway --> User : 201 meme orderId
end

== UC-03 - Activation de ligne ==

User -> Gateway : POST /v1/activations\nIdempotency-Key + customerId,\nofferId, simType, numberMode
Gateway -> Identity : /v1/auth/introspect
Identity --> Gateway : token valide
Gateway -> Orders : forward
Orders -> OrdersDb : find_by_idempotency_key(key)
Orders -> Identity : GET /v1/customers/{customerId}
Identity --> Orders : ACTIVE, VERIFIED, riskLevel
Orders -> Catalog : GET /v1/offers/{offerId}
Catalog --> Orders : offre ACTIVE
Orders -> Lines : POST /v1/lines/activate
Lines -> LinesDb : INSERT service_line\nstatus=PENDING
Lines -> Hlr : provision(line, TraceId)
Hlr --> Lines : provisioned
Lines -> LinesDb : UPDATE status=ACTIVE,\nhlrStatus=PROVISIONED
Lines --> Orders : lineId, msisdn,\nsimIdentifier, hlrStatus
Orders -> OrdersDb : INSERT activation\nstatus=ACTIVE,\nrequest_hash
Orders -> Audit : POST /v1/audit-events\nACTIVATION_COMPLETED
Audit -> AuditDb : INSERT audit_events
Orders --> Gateway : 201 activation ACTIVE
Gateway --> User : 201 ligne active

== UC-06 - Consultation facture et paiement ==

User -> Gateway : GET /v1/invoices?customerId={customerId}
Gateway -> Identity : /v1/auth/introspect
Identity --> Gateway : token valide
Gateway -> Billing : forward
Billing -> Identity : GET /v1/customers/{customerId}
Identity --> Billing : customer exists
Billing -> BillingDb : SELECT invoices\nou creer facture demo
Billing --> Gateway : 200 invoices
Gateway --> User : 200 factures

User -> Gateway : POST /v1/invoices/{invoiceId}/payments\nIdempotency-Key + SIMULATED_CARD,\namount, CAD
Gateway -> Identity : /v1/auth/introspect
Identity --> Gateway : token valide
Gateway -> Billing : forward
Billing -> BillingDb : find_payment_by_idempotency_key(key)
Billing -> BillingDb : SELECT invoice
Billing -> Audit : POST /v1/audit-events\nPAYMENT_REQUESTED
Audit -> AuditDb : INSERT audit_events
Billing -> Payment : charge(payment request)
Payment --> Billing : ACCEPTED,\ngatewayTransactionId
Billing -> BillingDb : INSERT payment ACCEPTED\nUPDATE invoice PAID
Billing -> Audit : POST /v1/audit-events\nPAYMENT_ACCEPTED, INVOICE_PAID
Audit -> AuditDb : INSERT audit_events
Billing --> Gateway : 201 payment ACCEPTED
Gateway --> User : 201 paiement confirme

== Audit trace ==

User -> Gateway : GET /v1/audit-events?traceId={TraceId}
Gateway -> Identity : /v1/auth/introspect
Identity --> Gateway : token valide
Gateway -> Audit : forward
Audit -> AuditDb : SELECT by traceId
Audit --> Gateway : 200 audit events
Gateway --> User : 200 traces auditables

note over Billing
UC-04 consultation d'usage detaillee et UC-08 cycle mensuel
sont hors scope implementation officielle Phase 1.
Le parcours E2E demontre la consultation de factures et UC-06 paiement.
end note

@enduml
